nored; the corrupted-state test uses the new shapes. docs/objectives.md updated (state, idempotency, invariant, economy, rumor flow). Checks run locally after npm ci: npm run typecheck, test:unit (679 passed), test:integration (36 passed), build: all exit 0.",
